# https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isan node1360
node1360 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>isan</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isan' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isan</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;International Standard Audiovisual Number (ISAN) &lt;https://www.isan.org/about/#what_is_isan&gt; is a unique 24-digit hexadecimal identifier for audiovisual works standardized by ISO 15706 &lt;https://www.iso.org/standard/83124.html&gt;. The ISAN remains persistent for a work regardless of its distribution format or its use. To facilitate human readability, the &quot;ISAN&quot; label, grouping hyphens, and two check characters are included (e.g., ISAN 0000-0000-3A8D-0000-Z-0000-0000-6); however, these elements shall be omitted when the identifier is stored electronically (e.g., 000000003A8D000000000000).&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;International Standard Audiovisual Number (ISAN) &lt;https://www.isan.org/about/#what_is_isan&gt; is a unique 24-digit hexadecimal identifier for audiovisual works standardized by ISO 15706 &lt;https://www.iso.org/standard/83124.html&gt;. The ISAN remains persistent for a work regardless of its distribution format or its use. To facilitate human readability, the &quot;ISAN&quot; label, grouping hyphens, and two check characters are included (e.g., ISAN 0000-0000-3A8D-0000-Z-0000-0000-6); however, these elements shall be omitted when the identifier is stored electronically (e.g., 000000003A8D000000000000).&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
