(provenance, composition, licensing, etc.) about a product.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;A container for a grouping of SPDX 3 content characterizing details
(provenance, composition, licensing, etc.) about a product.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;A Bill of Materials (BOM) is a container for a grouping of SPDX 3 content
characterizing details about a product.

This could include details of the content and composition of the product,
provenance details of the product and/or
its composition, licensing information, known quality or security issues, etc.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
